            <span class="font-bold text-ink block">{d.mitigationLabel}</span>
            <p id="diag-mitigation" class="text-muted leading-relaxed mt-0.5">
              Continue primary drying until Pirani and Baratron vacuum readings converge (<1.05x ratio); then advance shelf temperature to +35°C for secondary desorption.
